  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"M37-op-vocab KILLED\\nM58-probe-digest-eq KILLED\\nreverted ok\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 59,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 15,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
