{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d24b","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06ee5-ad0e-7750-9534-32e3571b58b2"},"sequence":1920,"recorded_at":1780531400003835,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"268a8b73-3d5a-46cf-996a-bd1fafa2d2a2","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"268a8b73-3d5a-46cf-996a-bd1fafa2d2a2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"268a8b73-3d5a-46cf-996a-bd1fafa2d2a2"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"51a3db82-eb2f-4821-b1e8-c46692271d47"},"task_id":"51a3db82-eb2f-4821-b1e8-c46692271d47","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"51a3db82-eb2f-4821-b1e8-c46692271d47","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 1-6\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-# Flight Logbook\n-\n-> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n-> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n-\n-## 2026-09-04\n+# Flight Logbook\n+\n+> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n+> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n+\n+## 2026-09-05\n+\n+### 0022 — Leaf-2 round-1 rework: refusal arms that share one code need clause assertions, not code assertions\n+\n+- SCOPE: TASK-260830-1zvmw7 rework after CHANGES REQUESTED (F1–F5, F9, G-A blocking; F6–F8 non-blocking). Production: `CheckOperation` admits `manifest`/`probe` with no capability dependency (§4.D); dead probe-identity branch and subsumed platform-dup check removed; `checkEvidenceSet` doc corrected to whole-reconciliation refusal. Tests: every refusal assertion in `manifest_test.go`/`manifest_pin_test.go` now names `*Error.Detail` (was 0/29); four over-determined `TestReconcileRefusals` fixtures narrowed until only the named rule rejects; `ParseProbe`/`ParseEvidence` gain the schema/version/identity/kind/digest cases only `ParseManifest` had; `now == expires_at` boundary row added.\n+- STRUCTURAL ROOT: ~110 of 121 arms return `CodeMismatch`, so deleting a gate slides its fixture onto a lower arm and a code-only suite stays green. The reviewer's arm-shift table (4 gates) reproduced exactly against the narrowed fixtures: each now fails at its named clause with the gate present and admits nothing with it deleted.\n+- F1 (live spec violation): `CheckOperation(\"manifest\"|\"probe\")` refused `terminal_backend_capability_unproven` even fully admitted; §4.D gives both `Capability dependencies: none` and neither row allows that code. Pinned by `TestCheckOperationAdmitsDependencyFreeOperations` (empty + full admitted sets, plus the still-refused gated operation).\n+- F3 NARROWING SHAPE: the AdmitProbe substitution fixture now tracks the foreign digest in the probe, so probe↔manifest identity holds and only the manifest↔record gate can refuse. Same-shape-different-arm cases are indistinguishable by any assertion when both arms share code AND detail — the fixture, not the assertion, must isolate the arm.\n+- G-A: new white-box `TestParsedClaimSlicesShareNoRegistryBacking` scribbles `REVIEW-POISON` into every parsed claim slice and re-reads the interior (row snapshot, `CapabilitiesForOperation`, fresh admission). The reviewer's positive control (return row slices from `parseClaim`) fails this pin while the old `TestAdmittedSharesNoBackingArrays` passed — that test touched three fields that cannot alias the table and never re-read the interior.\n+- EVIDENCE: reviewer batteries re-run — battery-1 46 killed/0 survived (12 formulation-compile-fails covered by battery-2's compilable variants, all killed; M37/M58 re-anchored after the F1/F8 edits, both killed); battery-2 43 killed with exactly the 4 expected survivors (M71/M72 JCS unprovable with ASCII-only closed schemas — reported as bound, not coverage; M92/M95 near-equivalents). Targeted re-verification of all 24 fix mutants: 24/24 killed, each grep-confirmed present, compiling, and reverted.\n+- F9: README `15.3#3` re-scoped (the prohibition is on advertising Structured Error as a capability; the admission registry is never on a hello path, clause stays undischarged), new `terminal-manifest-probe-admission` acceptance case registered, projection digest re-pinned, README figure 74→75 acceptance cases.\n+- STATUS: TASK-260830-1zvmw7 rework, handed to review.\n+\n+## 2026-09-04\n"}}}
